        "Cinematic dynamic scene in deep blue dream haze: The camera glides slowly forward, focusing on tightly closed crystal flower buds (starlight-sparkled, translucent) that sway gently with misty currents. As the lens pans right, more closed blooms blur into pulsing bokeh; sequined leaves tremble, scattering glimmers that trail light streaks. The camera then pulls back softly, the blue tone deepening from cyan to indigo, while the buds’ subtle sway syncs with drifting mist—all motion flowing in a quiet, breath-like rhythm, wrapping the scene in immersive, glittering cinematic serenity.",
